<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>提示 - 高考志愿填报分析系统</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="text-center px-6">
        <div class="text-6xl mb-6">⚠️</div>
        <h1 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3">服务暂时不可用</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6 text-sm md:text-base max-w-md mx-auto"><%= message %></p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
            <button onclick="location.reload()" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
                刷新重试
            </button>
            <a href="/" class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-200 transition">
                返回首页
            </a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-6">如果是数据库问题，请检查 MongoDB 服务是否正常运行</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
